{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S05、S07等段落的感受词偏密，容易让细节争夺注意力；S14还弱化了X中“等真的到了那时再说”的最终心理落点。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的短句拆分和重点高亮，让普通观众在听音乐时更容易迅速抓住人物每一步的心理变化；感受文字缩小并按音乐时点出现，也让画面不必同时承载所有信息。X的完整叙述在解释人物动机和保留心理转折细节方面更稳，但Y的感官描写更具体、与音乐进程的对应也更细，因此综合体验我选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "961fea37-acb5-4979-90a5-b88324a65a84", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T193835485182Z", "elapsed_seconds": 141.75, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:40:57.243356+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b90f2b746b1004229ed1223f0f67ae4aea94550d57c5d904a647348cd8064eed", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f630